                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Ford",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                        "entry_id": "ccab95c5-24de-30b3-914d-3c6137baae1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A make of car, named for Henry Ford, or a car (or other vehicle) of this make."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c40e7845-6bab-40a3-9afd-84f9bd283b25",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "They have a Ford car now, and she don't seem so far away from me as she used to."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5039909d-3c7d-4b7a-a7d1-a1a0804757b0",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "There were several of us and we had a little caravan — the Lanchester, a Packard, and a Ford or two."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "168696ce-0eff-447a-bca6-f70d751e8d4c",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "It is easy to see why the modern car manufacturer does not enjoy the eminence of a Ford or an Olds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "478eea54-da5d-44d1-b4f4-2a807aa94712",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "It's a girl, my Lord, in a flatbed Ford slowin' down to take a look at me"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3774a853-3745-4ffc-85b9-a2c2126e0f16",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "Why don't you go round the country with a Ford van, preaching on market days?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bd5c4af-42a5-453d-959c-4d209f254379",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "Unless, of course, he limped away, not sauntered off, maybe dragged himself to a hospital, maybe got out okay, maybe died, far from anything to tie him to a Ford extra cab, far from any ties to hometown news."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5de87a4f-8c0a-4c39-a3c6-8eda2e49b6db",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "And they can also live in a bigger house and drive something a little fancier than a Chevy or a Ford."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96d7b8ed-e524-41ab-9f64-3c461ca3ec31",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "But if he had a Ford automobile, he could simply telephone the garage, and--\n...\nWe didn't need a Ford motorcar."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47674bed-ffb9-4df7-8ecf-6fb8aa5c7422",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "Elmore Leonard is as dependable as a Ford used to be and as knowing as a New York fashion designer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fc92a4c-7c73-4c96-b7cb-f782909db5bf",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "When she spotted her stepfather coming towards her she had pulled over and Wodehouse crossed over to greet her, noticing too late that she was being followed by a Ford, which swerved to avoid the Buick."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffe64a8d-09a0-4e46-9968-889641c9a0e5",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "A Ford dealer in Saudi Arabia repeatedly warned the automaker the same year that Firestone tires were failing on Explorers.\n...\nA Ford memo in March 1999 said that Firestone's legal staff did not want to replace tires in Saudi Arabia for fear that doing so would require Firestone to notify NHTSA, and added that a Ford lawyer had worries \"similar to the Firestone concerns.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4ec9a36-1c5b-4a01-b620-2d6c03dfc664",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "He is disturbed not by the crass materialism of his life but by the fact that he is still driving a Ford when he could and should be driving a Porsche."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b3a38cc-c33b-44e1-a05c-65d400b7b095",
                                                "sense_id": "2e0b83f1-3fa6-3bce-916f-736bb81af22d",
                                                "text": "I remembered too late that Honey should probably drive a cute little Mini or a Ford Fiesta or some such. Damn."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
